Review-driven corrections:
- Serialize startup cancellation with runner control publication, so a task cannot
  start capture between a NotRunning observation and cancellation.
- Every actual sync credential read (including reconnect/recovery) uses a bounded,
  nonblocking, no-follow regular-file read with owner/private-permission/link checks.
  Not merely a startup preflight. Replacement FIFO/symlink/public-file tests added.
- Config reads reject special files and final symlinks, without echoing input values.
- Final service/task failure categories survive HTTP shutdown in redacted CLI logs.

